---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SEO from '@components/SEO.astro';

const lastUpdated = '15 January 2025';

const seoData = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy — Tenderpreneur | POPIA Compliant',
  description:
    'Tenderpreneur\'s privacy policy explains what personal information we collect, how we use it, and your rights under POPIA (Protection of Personal Information Act).',
  canonical: 'https://tenderpreneur.co.za/privacy',
  ogImage: 'https://tenderpreneur.co.za/og-default.png',
};
---

<BaseLayout>
  <SEO slot="head" {...seoData} />

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-900 to-civic-800 py-16 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb mb-6">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-sky-300">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
          <li aria-current="page" class="text-white">Privacy Policy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sky-300">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 dark:bg-navy-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="prose prose-tp mx-auto">

        <p class="lead">
          Tenderpreneur (Pty) Ltd ("Tenderpreneur", "we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and
          is committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with the Protection of
          Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 ("POPIA") and the regulations thereunder.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains what personal information we collect, why we collect it,
          how we use and protect it, and what rights you have as a data subject.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Tenderpreneur is a South African technology company that operates the tender intelligence
          platform at tenderpreneur.co.za and app.tenderpreneur.co.za. We are registered in South
          Africa and our Information Officer can be contacted at <a href="mailto:privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za">privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What personal information we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following categories of personal information:</p>

        <h3>Account information</h3>
        <p>
          When you register, we collect your name, email address, and password (hashed, never stored
          in plain text). We may also collect your company name and CIPC registration number if you
          choose to provide them.
        </p>

        <h3>CSD and compliance data</h3>
        <p>
          If you use our CSD compliance checker, we collect your Central Supplier Database (CSD)
          supplier number to verify your status. We do not store this beyond the verification
          session unless you explicitly save your profile.
        </p>

        <h3>Usage data</h3>
        <p>
          We collect anonymised data about how you use Tenderpreneur — which pages you visit, which
          tenders you save, and which searches you run. This data cannot be used to identify you
          individually. We use it to improve the platform.
        </p>

        <h3>Payment information</h3>
        <p>
          We do not store your credit card or banking details. All payments are processed by PayFast
          (Pty) Ltd, a PCI-DSS compliant payment gateway. PayFast's privacy policy applies to
          information you provide during checkout.
        </p>

        <h3>Communications</h3>
        <p>
          If you contact us by email or via the app, we retain those communications to resolve
          your query and improve our service.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Why we collect your information</h2>
        <p>We process your personal information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To create and manage your account</li>
          <li>To provide the services you have subscribed to</li>
          <li>To send you tender alerts and email newsletters you have opted into</li>
          <li>To process payments and manage subscriptions</li>
          <li>To respond to support requests and queries</li>
          <li>To improve and personalise the Tenderpreneur platform</li>
          <li>To comply with our legal obligations under South African law</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal basis for processing</h2>
        <p>We process your personal information on the following grounds under POPIA:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contract performance</strong> — to deliver services you've subscribed to</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate interest</strong> — to improve our platform and prevent fraud</li>
          <li><strong>Consent</strong> — for marketing communications (you may withdraw at any time)</li>
          <li><strong>Legal obligation</strong> — where required by South African law</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. How we protect your information</h2>
        <p>
          We implement technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information,
          including TLS encryption for all data in transit, AES-256 encryption for data at rest,
          access controls limiting who can view personal data, and regular security audits.
          No method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. If we become aware of a
          breach affecting your personal information, we will notify you and the Information
          Regulator as required by POPIA.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Who we share your information with</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>PayFast</strong> — for payment processing. Your payment details go directly to PayFast.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> — our hosting and CDN provider. They process request metadata to deliver the service.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Resend</strong> — our transactional email provider, used for account and alert emails.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Legal authorities</strong> — if required by a valid court order or South African law.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          All third-party processors are contractually bound to protect your information and
          process it only on our instructions.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your rights under POPIA</h2>
        <p>As a data subject, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of the personal information we hold about you
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Correction</strong> — request that inaccurate information be corrected
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Deletion</strong> — request that your personal information be deleted, subject to legal retention requirements
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Objection</strong> — object to processing for direct marketing at any time
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Withdraw consent</strong> — where processing is based on consent
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Complain</strong> — lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator of South Africa
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za">privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za</a>
          with your request. We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Retention periods</h2>
        <p>
          We retain account information for as long as your account is active and for three years
          thereafter for legal compliance. Usage logs are retained for 12 months. Payment records
          are retained for five years as required by the South African Revenue Service.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Tenderpreneur uses only essential cookies necessary for the platform to function —
          specifically, a session cookie to keep you logged in. We do not use advertising cookies
          or third-party tracking pixels. You can delete cookies from your browser at any time;
          doing so will log you out.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Tenderpreneur is not intended for persons under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal
          information from minors. If you believe a minor has registered, please contact us
          immediately at <a href="mailto:privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za">privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify registered users by
          email at least 14 days before material changes take effect. The "Last updated" date at
          the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy-related queries, contact our Information Officer:<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za">privacy@tenderpreneur.co.za</a><br />
          Postal: Tenderpreneur (Pty) Ltd, South Africa
        </p>
        <p>
          To lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator:<br />
          Website: <a href="https://www.justice.gov.za/inforeg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.justice.gov.za/inforeg</a><br />
          Email: inforeg@justice.gov.za
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
